            <p class="people-pi-role" data-en="Associate Professor · PhD Supervisor" data-zh="副教授 · 博士生导师">Associate Professor · PhD Supervisor</p>
            <p
              class="people-pi-affiliation"
              data-en="School of Information and Communication Engineering, BUPT"
              data-zh="北京邮电大学信息与通信工程学院"
            >School of Information and Communication Engineering, BUPT</p>
